<title>MEXICO: TENNIS-MEXICO V ARGENTINA DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEXICO V ARGENTINA DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Davis Cup world group qualifying tie between Mexico and Argentina on Friday (Mexican names first):</p>
<p>Alejandro Hernandez beat Gaston Etlis 7-6 (7-5) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Leonardo Lavalle lost to Hernan Gumy 6-7 (5-7) 4-6 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>5-7</p>
<p>(Mexico and Argentine are tied 1-1)</p>
</text>
